## Build from source

```powershell
cd runtime
cargo build --release --bin tech
cargo test
```

## VS Code

```powershell
cd vscode-extension
vsce package
code --install-extension techscript-1.0.6.vsix
```

## Optional: Python reference

```powershell
pip install -e .
.\scripts\parity_check.ps1
```

You do **not** need Python for normal use.

